// Date: 2022-12-27
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1134.001, attack.t1134.003
// Description: Detects execution of the SharpImpersonation tool. Which can be used to manipulate tokens on a Windows computers remotely (PsExec/WmiExec) or interactively
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((src.process.cmdline containsCIS " user:" AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS " binary:")) OR ((src.process.cmdline containsCIS " user:" AND src.process.cmdline containsCIS " shellcode:")) OR ((src.process.cmdline containsCIS " technique:CreateProcessAsUserW" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS " technique:ImpersonateLoggedOnuser"))) OR ((src.process.image.path endswithCIS "\\SharpImpersonation.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "SharpImpersonation.exe")))
